 /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Gem_(material)\" title=\"Gem (material)\">Gem</a>:</b> Items made of <b>gem</b> are generally extremely durable and have a very high <a href=\"/page/Hardness\" title=\"Hardness\">hardness</a>. Most commonly used to make trinkets and docents.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">21\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0002275000</span>2,275<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">0.25 lbs.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Gianthold_Tor\" title=\"Gianthold Tor\">Gianthold Tor</a></b>, White Dragon chest\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/page/Maximum_Charge_Tier\" title=\"Maximum Charge Tier\">Maximum Charge Tier</a>: IV</li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Cold_Bolts\" title=\"Cold Bolts\">Cold Bolts</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Freezing_Ice_Guard\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Freezing Ice Guard\">Freezing Ice&#32;Guard</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Freezing_Ice_Guard\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Freezing Ice Guard\">Freezing Ice&#32;Guard</a>:</b> This item stores the pitiless immovable power of the ice deep within. When the wearer of this item is successfully attacked in melee, this power occasionally comes to the surface, attempting to freeze an enemy solid and encase them in ice.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Cold_Resistance#Inherent_Resistances\" title=\"Cold Resistance\">Inherent Cold Resistance - 5</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Cold_Resistance#Inherent_Resistances\" title=\"Cold Resistance\">Inherent Cold Resistance - 5</a>:</b> This item provides a +5 <a href=\"/page/Insight_bonus\" title=\"Insight bonus\">Insight bonus</a> to your Cold resistance.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Weapon Boost</a> +2 or +4<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Weapon Boost</a> +2 or +4:</b> +2 or +4 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Melee_Power\" title=\"Melee Power\">Melee</a>, <a href=\"/page/Ranged_Power\" title=\"Ranged Power\">Ranged</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Universal_Spell_Power\" title=\"Universal Spell Power\">Universal Spell Power</a>.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span> and/or <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Shield Boost</a> +2 or +4<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Shield Boost</a> +2 or +4:</b> +2 or +4 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Physical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Physical Resistance Rating\">Physical</a> and <a href=\"/page/Magical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Magical Resistance Rating\">Magical</a> Resistance Ratings.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Rune_Arm_Imbue\" title=\"Rune Arm Imbue\">Rune Arm Imbue</a>: Cold III<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Rune_Arm_Imbue\" title=\"Rune Arm Imbue\">Rune Arm Imbue</a>: Cold III: Wearing this Rune Arm will imbue any weapon you wield, dealing 2d6 points of cold damage per hit.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Craftable_Rune_Arm\" title=\"Craftable Rune Arm\">Craftable Rune Arm</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: left;\">This Rune Arm is craftable and can be customized using recipes at standard crafting devices after disjuncting.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">\n<p><a href=\"/page/Essence_Crafting\" title=\"Essence Crafting\">Essence Crafting</a> \n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">\n<p><i>This armament draws the cold away from you, leaving it pleasantly warm to the touch.</i>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">\n<ul><li>Deconstructed: The following image shows what the Runearm looks like after being disjuncted in a post-U32 Item Deconstruction machine.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Chill_of_Winter_disjuncted.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Chill_of_Winter_disjuncted.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"438\" height=\"719\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Chill_of_Winter.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Chill_of_Winter.png/420px-Chill_of_Winter.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"675\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Chill_of_Winter.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817202122\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.100 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.158 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5172/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 39341/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9975/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 20/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  137.633      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  137.633      1 -total\n 94.93%  130.658      1 Template:Named_Rune_Arm\n 62.51%   86.035     55 Template:IO\n 23.49%   32.330      1 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 21.81%   30.021      1 Template:IsLamannia\n 20.85%   28.692      8 Template:Popup\n 19.98%   27.493      1 Template:IsSpeculation\n 18.18%   25.026      1 Template:InCategory\n 17.57%   24.179      1 Template:Non-food\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:19084-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817202122 and revision id 699566. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
